tary\",\"Music\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":664280,\"title\":\"David Attenborough: A Life on Our Planet\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zSKwyUDKDHiFU5syTTvQRDcGBPS.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHL4pwGzYS4njLpXhIjfc9skAQJ.jpg\",\"rating\":8.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The story of life on our planet by the man who has seen more of the natural world than any other. In more than 90 years, Attenborough has visited every continent on the globe, exploring the wild places of our planet and documenting the living world in all its variety and wonder. Addressing the biggest challenges facing life on our planet, the film offers a powerful message of hope for future generations.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":396194,\"title\":\"Ennio\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEuLAubp74HYztEyNYpEx3AoqOu.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iytQNneOp4lNSKktRh9T6Fo3UXk.jpg\",\"rating\":8.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A portrait of Ennio Morricone, the most popular and prolific film composer of the 20th century, the one most loved by the international public, a two-time Oscar winner and the author of over five hundred unforgettable scores.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Music\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":324558,\"title\":\"X-Rated: The Greatest Adult Movies of All Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uYzHkzZPp84B7nHOKaJZWjyGFUL.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3gw6ZMxVbfOQcQahGsmwdvFJPOa.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The evolution of adult cinema through the most influential films in history, a journey that begins in the 1970s and ends nowadays. An in-depth analysis of the success of the most prestigious erotic films, their impact on industry and society, and their influence on cinema and contemporary culture.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"